OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a quite chilly start in
OL,6,Fplaces it will develop to be a dry day
OL,7,Fwith prolonged bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping and light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the
OL,11,Fevening and overnight with clear
OL,12,Fspells and light winds allowing a few
OL,13,Ffog patches and a touch of frost to
OL,14,Fdevelop in sheltered glens.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA dry start with some
OL,17,Fbrightness towards the east coast at
OL,18,Ffirst but soon clouding over with a
OL,19,Ffew outbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
