OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clearing Tuesday morning, then
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,8,FWindy on Wednesday with bright spells,
OL,9,Frain likely later, this slowly
OL,10,Fclearing southeast later on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
